 country in North America. Its ten provinces and three territories extend from the Atlantic Ocean to the Pacific Ocean and northward into the Arctic Ocean, making it the second-largest country by total area, with the longest coastline of any country. Its border with the United States is the longest international land border. The country is characterized by a wide range of both meteorologic and geological regions. With a population of over 41 million, it has widely varying population densities, with the majority residing in its urban areas and large areas being sparsely populated. Its capital is Ottawa and its three largest metropolitan areas are Toronto, Montreal, and Vancouver.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canada","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"CA"}],"arc":{"reports":26,"first_seen":"2026-10-09T18:19:39Z","first_title":"September job losses pour cold water on Bank of Canada rate hike chatter","first_url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxOZWYwTll5M2xpMk5fVjh1aFlpRW1KelpCREhOdVZhYnBXVWcxMmo0NGNXbnhvZWdmd1c3U1pZMlRDQVQ2NkFabVUxYW50YXp4d3NIaUZzcTJOdjRQNjZrRk5JNnA5OUowREZUaUlkZFMwMThNcUs0S2NGWFlKR05nZk1wc19tYjdRUmc2WHVOUV9GVkZDcElzeF9fWXUtcUZCRkw3aFZHWXVndw?oc=5","first_publisher":"Lethbridge News Now","earlier":[{"id":"e_42e30a1f8600","title":"Banks raise prime rate after Bank of Canada interest rate increase","date":"2026-10-28T20:02:29Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNTE1SdnFGU3FTLTBJZUg4M09Md0VScDVkSlJIajdOTk5ZLTctUmJwSnBHZHVCWTVzWHpGbzdoSWRicjN2eEMzSk5VS3FmVWhBSmtkbVdnWXR6WHRhSnVzZ0EzalhlLV9Pb3JtTC0zUGppa0lTNU43VUdOS2xMLWN1YVluVmtPTGhpOGdmMXM0VFQyTFZNREFIM2NEVkFpMk51NUo0MnN2SmpQR1N4cm80YQ?oc=5","publisher":"Financial Post","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_32a73d28a6bd","title":"Bank of Canada hikes interest rate to contain inflation, but economists are split over timing","date":"2026-10-28T21:11:39Z","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","publisher":"The Hill Times","verific